@startuml
title tmux-bash-completion — build pipeline

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "tmux binary\n(per versions.txt entry)" as TmuxBin
component "generate.sh\n(parse)" as Parse
component "generate.sh\n(render)" as Render
component "core.bash\n(hand-written)" as CoreBash
component "build.sh" as Build
component "completions/tmux-<version>" as Versioned
component "completions/tmux" as Default
component "test/completion.bats" as CompletionTests

database "test/fixtures/\ntmux-<version>/" as Fixtures

TmuxBin --> Parse : "-h", "list-commands -F"
Parse --> Fixtures : captured once, committed
Parse --> Render : intermediate data\n(declare -A, in build/)
Render --> Build : case-dispatch fragment
CoreBash --> Build
Build --> Versioned
Versioned --> Default : --promote

Fixtures ..> Parse : test/generate.bats\n(hermetic, no tmux binary)
Versioned ..> CompletionTests : stubbed tmux

note bottom of Versioned
  diff completions/tmux-<old> vs
  completions/tmux-<new> to review
  what changed before promoting
end note

@enduml
